      "name": "Life-Siphoning Screech",
      "actions": 3,
      "category": "offensive",
      "traits": [
        "occult"
      ],
      "text": "The umbraex Flies, shrieking as it passes its enemies. Creatures within 20 feet of the umbraex's flight path take 22d6 mental damage depending on their DC 45 Fortitude save save.\n\n---\n\nCritical Success The creature is unaffected.\n\nSuccess The creature takes half damage and is Drained 1.\n\nFailure The creature takes full damage and is Drained 2.\n\nCritical Failure The creature takes double damage and is drained 2 and Doomed 1."
    }
  ],
  "text": "An umbraex appears at first glance to be a massive, majestic bird, much like a phoenix. Instead of compassion and warmth, however, it seethes with cold and hate. The umbraex is among the largest of the nihilistic undead called darvakkas."
